  questlines generated using this Tool;
— Claim the Tool or its derivatives as your own original creation, or 
  remove the original author attribution and this license text.


3. MONETIZATION AND COMMERCIAL TERMS

A. Free and Non-Commercial Use:
The following are fully EXEMPT from any donation obligations:
— Free distribution of derivative works, questlines, and modifications 
  within free modpacks and public servers;
— Purely voluntary donations (tips, server hosting contributions) that do NOT 
  restrict or lock access to content;
— Content monetization (YouTube videos, streams, tutorials) showcasing the Tool.

B. Indirect Commercial Use (Paywalled Access & Monetization):
If the Tool is used to create content for commercial projects (paid servers, 
projects with paywalled content access, or any other indirect profit generation), 
the Licensee assumes a strict OBLIGATION to donate at least 7% of their net 
profits to officially registered charitable organizations of their choice.

Exception: This condition does NOT apply to charities running shelters for 
stray animals (the Author advocates for systemic solutions and punishing irresponsible 
owners rather than treating consequences). Recommended causes include organizations 
supporting critically ill children, orphans, or people with disabilities.

4. NOTICE OF CONSCIENCE (AUTHOR'S SOLEMN DISCLAIMER)
The Author is a religious person, and his conscience belongs to God. Therefore, 
enforcement of this agreement is left entirely to the Licensee's personal honesty.

Bear this in mind: if you hide your income, violate this condition, or steal 
this work for sole personal enrichment — you are not stealing from the Author. 
You are stealing from the underprivileged, the weak, and the critically ill 
people whom this money could have helped. Everyone will ultimately answer to God 
for their own choices and integrity.

5. DISCLAIMER (AS IS) & ATTRIBUTION
This Tool is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind. The Author shall 
not be liable for any damages or data loss. The original text of this license and 
